[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_I]
Crystal Staff (Witchcraft)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_I_desc]
It all boils down to one simple issue: don’t you believe that a skilled sorcerer should have the best? If you walked into a magic equipment showroom in Equestria, you would buy the crystal staff! It’s lovely. It’s elegant. It’s beautiful! It is quite simply the best. In the world of magic, it is the Fleur de Lis Suit, the Cantelot Royal Corniche, the Sweet Apple Acres Zap Apple Cider. It is the staff that Rarity’s would sell you. What more can I say?
§g“Except that it costs a hoof-ton of crystals and don’t help the actual spell casting at all?” “Well you can say that about anything at Rarity’s!”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_I_short]
Crystal Staff

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_I]
水晶法杖 (巫术装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_I_desc]
这一切都归结为一个简单的问题：你不认为一名熟练的巫师应该拥有最好的吗？如果你走进小马国的魔法装备展室，你一定会买水晶法杖！那么可爱。那么优雅。那么美丽！它一定就是最好的。在魔法世界里，它是鸢尾花牌西装、坎特洛特皇家轿车、香甜苹果园的魔虹苹果酒。它是那种瑞瑞奢侈品店才会卖的法杖。还用我再多说什么吗？
§g“除了它要花费巨量的水晶制造，而对真正的施法毫无帮助，毫无实用价值？” “瑞瑞奢侈品店卖的东西不都这样吗？”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_CRYSTAL_STAFF_I_short]
水晶法杖
